### Customer-level NBA from Supabase with pgvector context and audit
GET http://127.0.0.1:8010/customers/{{customer_id}}/next-best-action?persist=false&retrieve_context=true&use_llm=false&audit=true

### Batch NBA, persist results, no per-row pgvector context for speed
POST http://127.0.0.1:8010/batch/next-best-actions?limit=100&persist=true&retrieve_context=false&use_llm=false&audit=true

